<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Algorithms</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithms <a href="#algorithm2" title="In A.1 Multi-agent workflow optimization ‣ Appendix A Algorithms ‣ Recursive Self-Improvement through Multi-Agent Self-Supervision" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and <a href="#algorithm3" title="In A.2 Workflow internalization ‣ Appendix A Algorithms ‣ Recursive Self-Improvement through Multi-Agent Self-Supervision" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> expand the two stages
of Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="In Overview. ‣ 3 Method ‣ Recursive Self-Improvement through Multi-Agent Self-Supervision" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. Within a generation, the executor,
evaluator, and workflow optimizer share the current model’s weights.
Workflow search changes prompts; SFT then changes the weights.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Multi-agent workflow optimization</h3>

<figure id="algorithm2" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span>Multi-agent workflow optimization</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm2.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>tasks <math id="algorithm2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>train</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}</annotation></semantics></math>; coding agent <math id="algorithm2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{A}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{A}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
current model <math id="algorithm2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}</annotation></semantics></math>; initial workflows <math id="algorithm2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{w_{t}^{(0)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{w_{t}^{(0)}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
evaluation prompt <math id="algorithm2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\mathrm{eval}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>eval</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\mathrm{eval}}</annotation></semantics></math>; optimization prompt
<math id="algorithm2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\mathrm{opt}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>opt</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\mathrm{opt}}</annotation></semantics></math>; iteration budget <math id="algorithm2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.2" class="ltx_listingline">Set <math id="algorithm2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}}={\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{eval}}={\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{opt}}={\mathcal{L}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>agent</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>eval</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>opt</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}}={\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{eval}}={\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{opt}}={\mathcal{L}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.3.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>train</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Execute <math id="algorithm2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\tau_{t}^{(0)},y_{t}^{(0)})\sim{\mathcal{A}}(x_{t}\oplus w_{t}^{(0)};{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>agent</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\tau_{t}^{(0)},y_{t}^{(0)})\sim{\mathcal{A}}(x_{t}\oplus w_{t}^{(0)};{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Set <math id="algorithm2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}^{*}\leftarrow w_{t}^{(0)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}^{*}\leftarrow w_{t}^{(0)}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="algorithm2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{t}^{*}\leftarrow y_{t}^{(0)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{t}^{*}\leftarrow y_{t}^{(0)}</annotation></semantics></math>,
and feedback history <math id="algorithm2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{t}\leftarrow\varnothing" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{t}\leftarrow\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.6.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,\ldots,I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,\ldots,I</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Propose <math id="algorithm2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}^{(i)}\leftarrow{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{opt}}(w_{t}^{(i-1)},w_{t}^{*},\mathcal{D}_{t};x_{\mathrm{opt}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>opt</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>opt</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}^{(i)}\leftarrow{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{opt}}(w_{t}^{(i-1)},w_{t}^{*},\mathcal{D}_{t};x_{\mathrm{opt}})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Execute <math id="algorithm2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\tau_{t}^{(i)},y_{t}^{(i)})\sim{\mathcal{A}}(x_{t}\oplus w_{t}^{(i)};{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>agent</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\tau_{t}^{(i)},y_{t}^{(i)})\sim{\mathcal{A}}(x_{t}\oplus w_{t}^{(i)};{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Compare <math id="algorithm2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{t}^{(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{t}^{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="algorithm2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{t}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{t}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> using <math id="algorithm2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{eval}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>eval</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{eval}}</annotation></semantics></math>
and <math id="algorithm2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\mathrm{eval}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>eval</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\mathrm{eval}}</annotation></semantics></math>, obtaining verdict and rationale <math id="algorithm2.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{t,i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{t,i}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Append <math id="algorithm2.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{t,i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{t,i}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="algorithm2.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.11.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{t}^{(i)}\succ y_{t}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>≻</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{t}^{(i)}\succ y_{t}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Set <math id="algorithm2.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}^{*}\leftarrow w_{t}^{(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}^{*}\leftarrow w_{t}^{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="algorithm2.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{t}^{*}\leftarrow y_{t}^{(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{t}^{*}\leftarrow y_{t}^{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> end if
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> end for
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.15" class="ltx_listingline">end foreach
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.16" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> retained workflows <math id="algorithm2.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{w_{t}^{*}\}_{t\in\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>train</mi></msub></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{w_{t}^{*}\}_{t\in\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.17" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The retained workflow is the best under the sequential self-comparisons.
Every proposal is executed, even if it does not replace the incumbent;
the quality of successive executions need not increase.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Workflow internalization</h3>

<figure id="algorithm3" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span>Workflow internalization by supervised fine-tuning</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm3.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm3.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm3.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>tasks <math id="algorithm3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>train</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}</annotation></semantics></math>; coding agent <math id="algorithm3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{A}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{A}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
current trainable model <math id="algorithm3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>; retained workflows <math id="algorithm3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{w_{t}^{*}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{w_{t}^{*}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
evaluation prompt <math id="algorithm3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\mathrm{eval}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>eval</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\mathrm{eval}}</annotation></semantics></math>; candidates per task <math id="algorithm3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math>;
selected trajectories per task <math id="algorithm3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K\leq M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K\leq M</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.2" class="ltx_listingline">Set <math id="algorithm3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}}={\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{eval}}={\mathcal{L}}_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>agent</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>eval</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}}={\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{eval}}={\mathcal{L}}_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math> and
<math id="algorithm3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{train}}=\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{val}}=\varnothing" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>train</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>val</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{train}}=\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{val}}=\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm3.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm3.4.3.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>train</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\mathcal{T}_{\mathrm{train}}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm3.4.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Execute <math id="algorithm3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> independent runs of
<math id="algorithm3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{A}}(x_{t}\oplus w_{t}^{*};{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>agent</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{A}}(x_{t}\oplus w_{t}^{*};{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{agent}})</annotation></semantics></math> to obtain
<math id="algorithm3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{(\tau_{t,j},y_{t,j})\}_{j=1}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{(\tau_{t,j},y_{t,j})\}_{j=1}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Compare workspace pairs with <math id="algorithm3.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{eval}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>eval</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{eval}}</annotation></semantics></math> and
<math id="algorithm3.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\mathrm{eval}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>eval</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\mathrm{eval}}</annotation></semantics></math>; fit Bradley--Terry scores;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Rank the trajectory–workspace pairs by descending score;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Add ranks <math id="algorithm3.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,\ldots,K-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,\ldots,K-1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="algorithm3.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{train}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>train</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{train}}</annotation></semantics></math>
and rank <math id="algorithm3.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="algorithm3.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{val}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>val</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{val}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.8" class="ltx_listingline">end foreach
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.9" class="ltx_listingline">Replace each orchestrator’s initial workflow prompt with the bare task;
retain worker assignments;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.10" class="ltx_listingline">Render training and validation windows with assistant-only loss masks;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.11" class="ltx_listingline">Optimize <math id="algorithm3.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math> on the training windows with <math id="algorithm3.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\mathrm{SFT}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>SFT</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\mathrm{SFT}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.12" class="ltx_listingline">Select <math id="algorithm3.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta^{+}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta^{+}</annotation></semantics></math> by the lowest validation loss;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm3.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> updated model <math id="algorithm3.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}_{\theta^{+}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}_{\theta^{+}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm3.4.14" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The collection directive used in our experiments is reproduced in
Appendix <a href="#A2.SS3" title="B.3 Teacher execution directive ‣ Appendix B Training data and optimization ‣ Recursive Self-Improvement through Multi-Agent Self-Supervision" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.3</span></a>. It is removed together with the
workflow from the orchestrator’s training input.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Training data and optimization</h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Tasks, teacher collection, and validation</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The private benchmark contains 12 research-programming tasks, with four
each in finance, pharmacy, and robotics <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lee et al., 2026</a>)</cite>.
Nine are designated for training. Task 221 is excluded from teacher
collection because workflow search finds no workflow that beats its
reference, leaving eight tasks that contribute SFT data
(Table <a href="#A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ B.1 Tasks, teacher collection, and validation ‣ Appendix B Training data and optimization ‣ Recursive Self-Improvement through Multi-Agent Self-Supervision" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>). The other three tasks are held out
from SFT, validation, and checkpoint selection. Workflow search is
also evaluated on these tasks; the split refers to post-training.</p>
</div>
