Task and trial counts are: ScienceAgentBench, <math id="A3.T7.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="102\times 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>102</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">102\times 3</annotation></semantics></math>;
