DSBench, <math id="A3.T7.m41" class="ltx_Math" alttext="74\times 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>74</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">74\times 3</annotation></semantics></math>; Terminal-Bench 2.0, <math id="A3.T7.m42" class="ltx_Math" alttext="89\times 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>89</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">89\times 3</annotation></semantics></math>; and
SWE-bench Verified, <math id="A3.T7.m43" class="ltx_Math" alttext="500\times 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">500\times 3</annotation></semantics></math>. The last two counts refer to
