<span id="A8.SS2.p1.p30.1" class="ltx_p">6) results/ablation_results.json logging each ablation (features/model) with config hash, metrics, and training time.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A8.SS2.p1.1.1.31" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A8.SS2.p1.1.1.31.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;"></span></span><span id="A8.SS2.p1.1.1.32" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A8.SS2.p1.1.1.32.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:10.0pt;"> </span><span id="A8.SS2.p1.1.1.32.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:387.5pt;">
