<span id="A8.SS2.p1.p32.1" class="ltx_p">Use uv for all Python workflows—run code with uv run, install dependencies with uv add, use uvx for tools. write your history log: write your plan, execution (or tool-execution), reflection during the reasoning logs in a logs.txt file.</span>
