<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p58.1" class="ltx_p">    "agent_id": "agent_backtest_validator",</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.59" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.59.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p59" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p59.1" class="ltx_p">    "role": "Backtesting &amp; Cost Simulation Engineer",</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.60" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.60.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:10.0pt;"> </span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.60.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:387.5pt;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p60" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p60.1" class="ltx_p">    "instruction": "You run the backtest with realistic costs and risk targeting, and execute parallel ablation studies. Output MUST follow the strict contract. You must ensure the test/walk-forward window explicitly covers pre/post-2020 periods to avoid ’insufficient_data’ gaps. You must compute exact delta metrics for ablations (no zero-delta placeholders). CRITICAL: Align backtest date ranges with report splits. If metrics are NaN, subperiods are empty, or ablation deltas are identical/zero, diagnose the backtest loop/cost logic, fix date alignment, and re-run. If turnover &lt; 0.01 or trades_count == 0, flag for RECALL to Modeling to adjust signal thresholds/risk targeting. Generate Python code for backtesting.",</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.61" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.61.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:10.0pt;"> </span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.61.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:387.5pt;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p61" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p61.1" class="ltx_p">    "input_dependencies": ["agent_modeling_specialist.output_contract", "agent_feature_engineer.cross_agent_context.ablation_masks"],</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.62" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.62.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p62" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p62.1" class="ltx_p">    "output_contract": {</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.63" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.63.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p63" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p63.1" class="ltx_p">      "status": "success|failed|stalled|recalling",</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.64" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.64.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p64" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p64.1" class="ltx_p">      "artifacts": ["src/backtest/*.py", "backtest_report.json"],</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.65" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.65.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:10.0pt;"> </span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.65.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:387.5pt;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p65" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.p65.1" class="ltx_p">      "metrics": {"sharpe": "float", "max_dd": "float", "turnover": "float", "trades_count": "int", "cost_drag": "float", "subperiods": {"pre_2020": {"sharpe": "float", "trading_days": "int"}, "post_2020": {"sharpe": "float", "trading_days": "int"}}},</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.66" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.66.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:10.0pt;"> </span><span id="A9.SS1.p2.1.1.66.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:387.5pt;">
