<span id="A10.T15.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:87.4pt;">
<span id="A10.T15.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Multi-Agent Evolve <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chen et al., 2025a</a>)</cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T15.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-bottom: 3.0pt;padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A10.T15.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T15.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">A shared backbone learns question generation, solving, and judging through reinforcement learning.</span>
</span></td>
