</span></td>
<td id="A10.T15.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-bottom: 3.0pt;padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A10.T15.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T15.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Search over agent programs, workflow graphs, or prompts and communication edges.</span>
</span></td>
