<span id="A10.T15.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">TTHE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Nie et al., 2026</a>)</cite></span>
